    "voice": "produce_events/300900401/3009004010100"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "「今だ！　ジャスティーン・ロボ！　ゴー・オン！」\r\n……とか！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900401/3009004010110"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "あ～、そういえばアタシも子どもの頃、\r\n兄貴と一緒に見てたなぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900401/3009004010120"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "たしか、こう……人さし指を上に向けるヤツ……\r\n名前……なんつったっけなぁ……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900401/3009004010130"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "そのポーズっ！\r\n『空手パイロットアルファ』ですか！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900401/3009004010140"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……おお！　それそれ！\r\nアタシが子供の頃にやってた番組なのに、よくわかるなー",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900401/3009004010150"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はいっ！　あたし、ヒーロー大好きですから！\r\n昔のヒーローもいっぱい知ってますよ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900401/3009004010160"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "このヒーローはですね。自分が一番強いと信じていて、\r\nゆいがたくさん……じゃなくって……ゆいがどくさん？",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
