    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900401/3009004010310"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "へぇ。そのときはやっぱり、果穂がヒーロー役なのか？",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900401/3009004010320"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "いえっ。お友達みんなでジャンケンです！\r\nヒーロー役はとっても人気ですから",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900401/3009004010330"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "でもでも、悪役になったとしても楽しいんです\r\nみんなで作り上げるステージみたいでしたから！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900401/3009004010340"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "そう言われると、何だか面白そうだな！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900401/3009004010350"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい！　樹里ちゃんは、スゴく強そうだから、\r\n悪の帝王役とかが似合うと思います！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/300900401/3009004010360"
  },
  {
    "id": null,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "えぇ……アタシ、敵なのかよ",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
